{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年35歲的前港姐冠軍陳凱琳（Grace），近年已正式離開無綫電視（TVB）轉型為自由身KOL，並積極發展個人事業及參與內地綜藝節目。</p><p>日前陳凱琳出席活動，並分享一輯靚相到社交平台，可見現場星光熠熠，包括歌手Tyson Yoshi、廿四味成員</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:54.236052+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:48:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:06.094284+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:38:06.094284+00:00","content_hash":"c6dc4898fcae7c35a96894e15ad88e51d045896015a3472dcbd6f4e047972d92","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}